cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Cross-ethnic machine learning prediction of insulin resistance in non-diabetic adults"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a gradient boosting model that predicts insulin resistance
  (HOMA-IR > 2.5) in non-diabetic adults from routine clinical measurements,
  trained on NHANES and KNHANES and applied to the Taiwan Biobank cohort, with
  SHAP-based interpretation and a differential DNA methylation analysis of the
  predicted groups.
type: software
license: MIT
